WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:06.360
Invoices: pro-forma and tax invoices, payments and due dates.

2
00:00:06.907 --> 00:00:11.970
Open the invoice and record the amount and transfer number with "Record payment".

3
00:00:12.518 --> 00:00:16.300
For a manual invoice, click "New invoice".

4
00:00:16.849 --> 00:00:22.960
Send the "Invoice page" or "Statement" to the customer; cancel a wrong invoice with "Void".

5
00:00:23.505 --> 00:00:29.060
Don't delete an invoice; void it, as the financial record must stay.
